# Citation metadata for this repository (Citation File Format 1.2.0).
# Standardized across the sustainable-fsa organization; the same
# citation appears in human-readable form in README.md.
#
# NOTE: Zenodo ignores this file. Because `.zenodo.json` is present, it
# fully overrides CITATION.cff for GitHub release archiving (Zenodo does
# not merge the two). Keep the title, authors, and keywords here in sync
# with `.zenodo.json`, or Zenodo records will drift from this citation.
# GitHub's "Cite this repository" button still reads this file.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using these metadata."
type: dataset
title: "Vintage-Matched US Census American Indian / Alaska Native / Native Hawaiian (AIANNH) Area Boundaries (Sustainable FSA Archive)"
authors:
  - name: "U.S. Census Bureau"
  - family-names: Bocinsky
    given-names: R. Kyle
    affiliation: "Montana Climate Office, University of Montana"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sustainable-fsa/census-aiannh"
url: "https://sustainable-fsa.com/census-aiannh/"
keywords:
  - AIANNH
  - tribal boundaries
  - American Indian reservations
  - off-reservation trust land
  - Alaska Native village statistical areas
  - Hawaiian home lands
  - TIGER/Line
  - USDA
